  [PASS] MP1.a a_0 x 0.25 must be visibly worse than a_0 canonical on the same zero-parameter prediction   (chi2 7647.9 vs 3325.8 (delta +4322.2 on 230 points))
  [PASS] MP1.a a_0 x 4.0 must be visibly worse than a_0 canonical on the same zero-parameter prediction   (chi2 5367.3 vs 3325.8 (delta +2041.5 on 230 points))
  [PASS] MP1.b permuting which g_bar carries which measured Delta Sigma inside each stack must ruin the fit -- the prediction uses the SHAPE, so destroying the pairing has to be visible   (shuffled chi2 422462.7 vs real 3325.8)

  [PASS] MP1.c injecting a_0 = 0.25x canonical into synthetic profiles built on these stacks' own covariance must be recovered   (injected 2.3400e-11, median of 24 recoveries 2.2875e-11 (-0.0099 dex))
  [PASS] MP1.c injecting a_0 = 1.0x canonical into synthetic profiles built on these stacks' own covariance must be recovered   (injected 9.3600e-11, median of 24 recoveries 9.3731e-11 (+0.0006 dex))
  [PASS] MP1.c injecting a_0 = 4.0x canonical into synthetic profiles built on these stacks' own covariance must be recovered   (injected 3.7440e-10, median of 24 recoveries 3.7315e-10 (-0.0015 dex))

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
8.  VERDICT
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * P1's collapse is REAL and it is TIGHT: sixteen lens stacks (NOT sixteen independent samples -- see 3d)
    lie on one Lambda-normalised curve
    with 0.089 dex of stack-to-stack scatter and no parameter fitted.  Reported as a consistency.
  * P1 is a RESTATEMENT.  Two proofs, both executed above: the collapse abscissa R/r_M is IDENTICALLY
    (g_bar/a_0)^(-1/2), so the collapse plane is the lensing RAR plane -- Brouwer et al. 2021's own published
    result -- and the ordinate follows from v^4 = G M_b a_0 by projection, to 0.6% at the median released bin
    and 13.5% at the single deepest one.  The 'transition' that P1 offered as the non-restatement content is not in these data at all: the
